# Secrets for local development, read by @genoacms/adapter-secrets-env.
#
# GenoaCMS creates everything it needs here on first start — signing key seeds and
# the key registry sequence. Nothing has to be set by hand.
#
# This file exists so the adapter has somewhere to write. Copy it and leave it empty:
#
#   mkdir -p .genoacms && cp secrets.env.example .genoacms/secrets.env
#
# `.genoacms/` is gitignored; this file is not, so never put a real secret here.
